#: feedreading_blogroll.php:121 feedreading_blogroll.php:1210
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:2481 feedreading_blogroll.php:2513
msgid "This widget adds the WP Social Blogroll to your sidebar."
msgstr "Ovaj vidzet dodaje WP Social Blogroll vasoj koloni sa strane"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:121 feedreading_blogroll.php:1210
msgid ""
"It can display multiple link categories. Only a single instance of this "
"widget can be added to your sidebars."
msgstr ""
"Moze prikazati vise link kategorija. Samo jedan primer ovog vidzeta moze "
"biti dodat vasim kolonama sa strane."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:161
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Podesavnja"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:543
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Podesavanja sacuvana"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:579 feedreading_blogroll.php:2554
msgid ""
"You are currently using WordPress version %s. Please be informed, that "
"future versions of the WP Social Blogroll plugin will no longer support this "
"version of WordPress. I recommend to upgrade your WordPress-installation to "
"<a href=\"http://wordpress.org\">the latest version</a>."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno koristite WordPress verziju %s. Molim vas imajte u vidu da buduce "
"versije WP Social Blogroll plagina nece podrzavati ovu verziju WordPress-a. "
"Preporucujem da apgrejdujete vasu WordPress instalaciju na  <a href=\"http://"
"wordpress.org\">the latest version</a>."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:589 feedreading_blogroll.php:2547
msgid ""
"If you have just upgraded to WordPress 2.8, you will have to add the Widget "
"of the WP Social Blogroll plugin to your sidebar again. <a href=\"%s"
"\">Please go to the Widget-Settings-Page</a> to add the widget to your "
"sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste upravo apgrejdovali na WordPress 2.8, moracete da dodate vidzet "
"WP Social Blogroll plagina u vasu kolonu sa strane ponovo. <a href=\"%s\"> "
"Molim idite na Vidzet-Podesavanja-Stranicu</a> da bi dodali vidzet u vasu "
"kolonu sa strane."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:601
msgid ""
"JavaScript-file <strong>and</strong> content-directory are writable. This is "
"no longer necessary. You should make the content-directory read-only (chmod "
"755) now for security-reasons.</p><p>This plugin requires <strong>only</"
"strong> JavaScript-file itself to be writable."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript-fajl <strong>i</strong> direktorijum za sadrzaj su upisivi. Ovo "
"vise nije neophodno. Trebali biste podesiti da direktorijum za sadrzaj bude "
"read-only (chmod 755) sada, iz bezbednosnih razloga. </p><p> Ovaj plagin "
"zahteva da <strong>samo</strong> JavaScript-fajl bude upisiv."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:608
msgid "Content directory and/or JavaScript-file not writable!"
msgstr "Direktorium za sadrzaj i/ili JavaScript fajl nije upisiv!"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:616
msgid "Developer&rsquo;s Blog"
msgstr "Blog developera&rsquo;s "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:617
msgid "Subscribe to the Developer&rsquo;s RSS-Feed"
msgstr "Pretplatite se na novosti Developera&rsquo;s "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:617
msgid "RSS-Feed"
msgstr "RSS-Novosti"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:621
msgid "Plugin Home"
msgstr "Plagin Pocetna strana"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:624
msgid "Download latest Version"
msgstr "Skini najnoviju verziju"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:628
msgid "Supportforum"
msgstr "Forum podrske"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:632 feedreading_blogroll.php:824
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Pomoc"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:632
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:636
msgid "Facebook"
msgstr "Facebook"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:644 feedreading_blogroll.php:651
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:661 feedreading_blogroll.php:737
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:831 feedreading_blogroll.php:919
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:925 feedreading_blogroll.php:1096
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1148 feedreading_blogroll.php:1214
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:2518
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:645 feedreading_blogroll.php:1143
msgid "URL-Check"
msgstr "URL- Provera"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:646 feedreading_blogroll.php:1094
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:647 feedreading_blogroll.php:1122
msgid "News"
msgstr "Vesti"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:659 feedreading_blogroll.php:1090
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Sacuvaj izmene"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:664
msgid "Google API Key"
msgstr "Google Api Kljuc"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:667
msgid "This field is optional!"
msgstr "Ovo polje je opcionalno!"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:671
msgid "Blogroll Title for sidebar widget"
msgstr "Blogroll naslov za kolonu sa strane"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:680
msgid "Display title above blogroll"
msgstr "Prikazi naslov iznad blogroll-a"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:684
msgid "Use Google Feed Discovery"
msgstr "Upotrebi Otkrivanje Google Novosti "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:689 feedreading_blogroll.php:703
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:726 feedreading_blogroll.php:764
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:795 feedreading_blogroll.php:820
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:879 feedreading_blogroll.php:909
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:975 feedreading_blogroll.php:1003
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1044
msgid "Click me for help"
msgstr "Klikni me za pomoc"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:692
msgid ""
"Automatic Feed Discovery is a service by Google which will try to find the "
"correct feeds that belong to your bookmarks. When using Feed Discovery, you "
"do not need to save extra feed-URLs along with your bookmarks. If you have "
"saved a feed-URL for a bookmark, the plugin will always use the saved feed "
"for that particular bookmark instead of Google Feed Discovery."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko Otkrivanje Google Novosti je servis u sklopu Google-a koji ce "
"pokusati da nadje tacne novosti koje pripadaju vasim sacuvanim stranama. Kad "
"koristite Otkrivanje Novosti, ne morate da sacuvate dodatne URL novosti "
"zajedno sa vasim vec sacuvanim stranama. Ukoliko ste sacuvali URL odredjene "
"novosti kao sacuvanu stranu, plagin ce uvek koristiti sacuvanu novost za tu "
"odredjenu sacuvanu stranicu umesto da koristi Otkrivanje Google Novosti."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:698
msgid "Use Google Favicon Discovery"
msgstr "Koristi Google Favicon Otkrivanje"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:706
msgid ""
"Automatic Favicon Discovery is a service by Google which will try to find "
"the correct favicons that belong to your bookmarks. When using Favicon "
"Discovery, you do not need to save extra icon-URLs along with your "
"bookmarks. If you have saved a icon-URL for a bookmark, the plugin will "
"always use the saved icon for that particular bookmark instead of Google "
"Favicon Discovery."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko Oktrivanje Google Favicon je servis u sklopu Google-a koji ce "
"pokusati da nadje tacne favikone koje pripadaju vasim sacuvanim stranama. "
"Kad koristite Otkrivanje Favicon, ne morate da sacuvate dodatne URL ikonica "
"zajedno sa vasim vec sacuvanim stranama. Ukoliko ste sacuvali URL odredjene "
"ikonice kao sacuvanu stranu, plagin ce uvek koristiti sacuvanu ikonicu za tu "
"odredjenu sacuvanu stranicu umesto da koristi Otkrivanje Google Favicon."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:714
msgid "JavaScript loading in"
msgstr "JavaScript ucitavanje"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:721
msgid "Pageheader"
msgstr "Zaglavlje stranice"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:721 feedreading_blogroll.php:895
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standardno"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:724
msgid "Pagefooter"
msgstr "Podnozje (futer) stranice"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:729
msgid ""
"Loading of the JavaScript from your blog&rsquo;s header is better for the "
"compatibility, while loading it from the footer is better for the "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Ucitavanje JavaScript-a sa zaglavlja vaseg bloga&rsquo;s  je bolje za "
"kompatibilnost, dok je ucitavanje s podnozja tj futera bolje za performans."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:736 feedreading_blogroll.php:2527
msgid "Link categories"
msgstr "Link kategorije"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:739
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorije"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:767
msgid "Add a category to your blogroll by activating its checkbox."
msgstr "Dodaj kategoriju u svoj blogroll aktiviranjem njenog cekboksa"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:768
msgid ""
"Use drag and drop to reorder the categories, then save the changes with the "
"button above."
msgstr ""
"Koristi drag&drop (vuci i ispusti) da bi promenio redosled kategorija, a "
"onda sacuvaj izmene klikom na dugme iznad."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:781
msgid "Single Category Widgets"
msgstr "Vidzeti pojedinacnih kategorija"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:790
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Vidzet"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:798
msgid ""
"You have added these widgets to your sidebar from the Widget-Panel. There, "
"you can edit the widget-titles and the order of the widgets."
msgstr ""
"Dodali ste ove vidzete u vase kolone sa strane sa Vidzet Panela. Tamo mozete "
"izmeniti naslove vidzeta kao i njihov redosled."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:806
msgid "Group bookmarks by category"
msgstr "Grupisi sacuvane strane po kategorijama"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:815
msgid "Enable Linkpage"
msgstr "Omoguci Linkpage"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:823
msgid "Enable this option, if you are using the blogroll on a linkpage."
msgstr "Omoguci ovu opciju, ukoliko koristite blogroll na linkpage-u."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:830
msgid "Sorting"
msgstr "Sortiranje"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:833
msgid "Order bookmarks by"
msgstr "Rasporedi sacuvane stranice po "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:865
msgid "ascending"
msgstr "rastuce"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:869
msgid "descending"
msgstr "opadajuce"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:874
msgid "Enable JavaScript-sorting"
msgstr "Omoguci JavaScript-sortiranje"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:882
msgid "JavaScript-sorting allows sorting by &quot;latest update&quot;."
msgstr ""
"JavaScrips sortiranje omogucava sortiranje po  &quot;posledne "
"azuriranje&quot;."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:888
msgid "JavaScript-sorting timeout"
msgstr "JavaScript sortiranje- vreme isteklo"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:895 feedreading_blogroll.php:898
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:901 feedreading_blogroll.php:904
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:907
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Sekunde"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:912
msgid "Try to sort the blogroll with JavaScript for this amount of seconds."
msgstr ""
"Pokusajte da sortirate blogroll sa JavaScriptom u okviru ovog broja sekundi"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:918
msgid "Display Options"
msgstr "Opcije displeja"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:921
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stil"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:930
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "Minimal"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:932
msgid "Displays the blogname and age of latest article."
msgstr "Prikazuje naziv bloga i starost poslednjeg clanka"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:938
msgid "Classic"
msgstr "Klasicno"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:940
msgid ""
"Displays the blogname and below that in one single line the age of the "
"latest article and its title."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje naziv bloga i ispod toga u jednoj jedinoj liniji starost "
"poslednjeg clanka i njegov naslov."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:946
msgid "Blogger(TM)"
msgstr "Blogger(TM)"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:948
msgid ""
"Displays the blogname, the age of the latest article and its title. Each "
"element in its own line."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje naziv bloga, starost poslednjeg clanka i njegov naziv. Svaki "
"element prikazan u zasebnoj liniji."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:954
msgid "Banners"
msgstr "Baneri"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:956
msgid ""
"The bookmark is displayed as a banner-link. Below the image the age of the "
"latest article and its title are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Sacuvana strana je prikazana kao baner-link. Ispod slike su prikazani "
"starost posledneg clanka i njegov naziv."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:962
msgid "Rolling"
msgstr "Rolling"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:964
msgid ""
"A very compact, animated style. All bookmarks will show up, but only five of "
"them at a time. Every few seconds, a new bookmark will fade in at the top, "
"while another one will fade out at the bottom of the blogroll."
msgstr ""
"Vrlo kompaktan, animirani stil. Sve sacuvane strane ce se prikazati, ali "
"samo pet njih istovremeno. Na svakih par sekundi, nova sacuvana strana ce "
"izbledeti i nestati na vrhu, a druga ce izbledeti i nestati na dnu blogroll-"
"a."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:971
msgid "Max number of bookmarks per category"
msgstr "Maximalni broj sacuvanih strana po kategoriji "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:974
msgid ""
"Enter a positive integer without point or other special characters. "
"Examples: 3, 5, 10, 15, ..."
msgstr ""
"Unesite pozitivan prirodni broj bez tacaka ili bilo kakvih specijalnih "
"oznaka. Primeri: 3, 5, 10, 15, ..."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:978
msgid ""
"Enter the maximum number of bookmarks that should be visible in each "
"category. Leave the field empty, if you want all bookmarks to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Unesite maksimalan broj sacuvanih strana koji bi trebali biti vidljivi u "
"svakoj kategoriji. Ostavite polje prazno ukoliko zelite da sve sacuvane "
"strane budu prikazane."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:979
msgid ""
"If JavaScript-sorting is active, the limiting will be applied after the "
"JavaScript-sorting timeout."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je JavaScript-sortiranje aktivno, ogranicenje ce biti primenjeno "
"nakon sto je isteklo vreme JavaScript-sortiranja. "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:985
msgid "Custom location for stylesheets"
msgstr "Prilagodjene lokacije za stilove"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:994
msgid "No custom location was specified."
msgstr "Nijedna prilagodjena lokacija nije specifikovana"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:996
msgid "Using default instead: "
msgstr "Koristi standardnu umesto toga"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1006
msgid ""
"Examples: &quot;http://yourblog.com/wp-content&quot; or &quot;http://"
"yourblog.com&quot; or &quot;http://yourblog.com/wp-content/css&quot;."
msgstr ""
"Primeri: &quot;http://yourblog.com/wp-content&quot; or &quot;http://yourblog."
"com&quot; or &quot;http://yourblog.com/wp-content/css&quot;."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1009
msgid ""
"If you modify the file feedreading_blogroll.css, it is recommended to move "
"it to another directory (e.g. /wp-content) to prevent it from getting lost "
"during a plugin-update."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko izmenite fajl  feedreading_blogroll.css, preporucljivo je da ga "
"premestite u drugi direktorijum (npr. /wp sadrzaj) da bi sprecili njegovo "
"gubljenje tokom azuriranja plagina."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1015
msgid "Default icon"
msgstr "Standardna ikona"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1022
msgid "CSS class for links"
msgstr "CSS klasa za linkove"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1029
msgid "Show update-information"
msgstr "Prikazi informacije o azuriranju"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1034 feedreading_blogroll.php:1423
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1474 feedreading_blogroll.php:1517
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1569 feedreading_blogroll.php:1616
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1666
msgid "last change"
msgstr "poslednja promena"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1034 feedreading_blogroll.php:1783
msgid "%d hrs ago"
msgstr "pre %d sati"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1034 feedreading_blogroll.php:1779
msgid "%d days ago"
msgstr "pre %d dana"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1034 feedreading_blogroll.php:1781
msgid "yesterday"
msgstr "juce"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1038
msgid "Show name of author"
msgstr "Prikazi ime autora"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1043
msgid ""
"This option requires the enabled option <em>Show update-information</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija zahteva da opcija <em>Prikazi informacije o azuriranju</em> bude "
"omogucena."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1047
msgid ""
"Some blogs do not provide the author&rsquo;s name in their feed. In those "
"cases, the author&rsquo;s name cannot be shown in the blogroll."
msgstr ""
"Neki blogovi ne omogucuju prikazivanje imena autora&rsquo;s u njihovim "
"novostima. U tim slucajevima, ime autora&rsquo;s ne moze biti prikazano u "
"blogroll-u."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1053 feedreading_blogroll.php:1068
msgid "Show title of latest post"
msgstr "Prikazi naslov poslednjeg posta"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1061
msgid "Bookmark tooltip"
msgstr "Sacuvaj tooltip"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1066
msgid "No tooltip"
msgstr "bez tooltipa"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1067
msgid "Show blog description from feed"
msgstr "Prikazi opis bloga iz novosti"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1073
msgid "Show icon"
msgstr "Prikazi ukonu"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1081
msgid "Enable bookmark preview"
msgstr "Omoguci pregled sacuvanih strana "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1098
msgid "JavaScript file"
msgstr "JavaScript fajl"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1100
msgid ""
"This file renders article-titles and date-information into your blogroll. It "
"is rebuild automatically by the plugin each time your bookmarks or the "
"options of this plugin change. You can rebuild it manually by clicking the "
"button below."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj fajl omogucava naslove clanaka kao i datum i informacije na vasem "
"blogroll-u. Obnovljen je automatski od strane plagina svaki put kada se vase "
"sacuvane strane ili opcije ovog plagina promene. Mozete ga obnoviti rucno "
"klikom na dugme ispod. "

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1102
msgid "Last rebuild:"
msgstr "Poslednja obnova:"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1103 feedreading_blogroll.php:1691
msgid "dS F, Y h:i:s a"
msgstr "dS F, Y h:i:s a"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1108
msgid "Rebuild file"
msgstr "Obnovi fajl"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1124
msgid "You are using version"
msgstr "Koristite verziju"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1145
msgid ""
"This section will tell you, if RSS-URLs or image-URLs are missing. Update-"
"information in the blogroll can only be displayed if you have saved the "
"necessary URLs."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj odeljak ce vam reci da li neki RSS-URL ili neki URL od slike nedostaje. "
"Informacije o azuriranju u blogroll-u mogu biti prkazane samo ukoliko ste "
"sacuvali neophodne URL."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1162
msgid "Web Address"
msgstr "Web adresa"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1164
msgid "RSS Address"
msgstr "RSS adresa"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1168
msgid "via Google Feed Discovery"
msgstr "preko Otkrivanja Google Novosti"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1170 feedreading_blogroll.php:1180
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Upozorenje"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1170
msgid "No RSS address! Please provide a feed-url for this bookmark!"
msgstr "Nema RSS adrese! Molim obezbedite url novosti za ovu sacuvanu stranu!"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1173 feedreading_blogroll.php:1183
msgid "Edit Link"
msgstr "Izmeni link"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1176
msgid "Image Address"
msgstr "Adresa slike"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1180
msgid ""
"No image address! If you have configured a default icon, it will be used."
msgstr ""
"Nema adrese slike! Ukoliko ste konfigurisali podrazumevanu (standardnu) "
"ikonu, bice upotrebljena."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1380 feedreading_blogroll.php:1429
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1522 feedreading_blogroll.php:1573
#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1620 feedreading_blogroll.php:1670
msgid "Close preview"
msgstr "Zatvori pregled"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1785
msgid "in the last hour"
msgstr "u poslednjih sat vremena"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1787
msgid "just recently"
msgstr "u skorije vreme"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:1853
msgid "by"
msgstr "od"

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:2481 feedreading_blogroll.php:2513
msgid ""
"It can display one single link category. An arbitrary number of instances of "
"this widget can be added to your sidebars."
msgstr ""
"Moze prikazati jednu jedinu link kategoriju. Proizvoljan broj primera ovog "
"vidzeta moze biti dodat u vasu kolonu sa strane."

#: feedreading_blogroll.php:2521
msgid "Title:"
msgstr "Naslov:"
